		(property "Description" "Keyed 1 mm JST SH six-position header, signal currents only. Mate six-position SHR-06V-S(-B); use four SSH-003T-P0.2-H contacts or verified precrimped AWG28 leads in positions1,2,5,6 only. Positions3/4 are DNC: no net, no GND, no wire or crimp contact. NC1 C->pin1, NC->pin2; NC2 C->pin5, NC->pin6. Both NO unused and insulated; no LED connection. Empty positions separate CUT and STATUS at this connector, not general harness short-circuit protection."
